# .venv is ~500MB of spacy, simplemma and it_core_news_sm wheels, reproducible
# from the README's commands. .build is what the serial's release-gate pipeline
# generates on each run: fondamentale.js exported to the checker's lexicon
# shape, and each episode's canonical text. The committed artefact is the
# *report* — under src/data/serial-reports/, because that is the measurement
# npm test holds the shipped prose to.
.venv/
.build/
it_freq_raw.txt
lexicon_*.json
results.json
summary.json
__pycache__/
